kantGrammarNames -- SEQ 436 R3 (2026-10-27). Run by genLadder/kantGrammarNames.sh, not alone.
It walks every registry the runtime keeps (the `registries` registry), printing KGR <registry> then KGM <member> for
each member. kantGrammar is NOT loaded here, so the dump is the world the new names must not collide with. Its sibling
incant/probes/kantGrammarLoad loads the file and lists what it registered.
